t. in verse); 22:32 (all P); especially 5 tribal chiefs and representatives , according to the religious organization of P, Num 1:16 , 44 ; 2:3 57t. Numbers (especially chapters 2, 7, 34; note הַלֵּוִי נְשִׂיאֵי נְשִׂיא 3:32 ); compare 1Chr 2:10 ; 4:38 ; 5:6 ; 7:40 ; 2Chr 1:2 , also 1Kin 8:1 (probably gloss, omitted by ᵐ5 Benz), 2Chr 5:2 . 6 in Ezekiel: a. of Zedekiah (for מֶלֶךְ see Böhmer 8K 1900, 112 ff. ), Ezek 7:27 ; 12:10 , 12 ; 21:30 , + 19:1 (read singular ᵐ5 Ew Hi Co Berthol Toy). b. chief men of Judah Ezek 21:17 ; 22:6 ; 45:8-9 ,. c. future Davidic king Ezek 34:24 ; 37:25 , compare 44:3 (twice in verse) + 16 t. Ezekiel 45, 46, 48. d. foreign princes Ezek 26:16 ; 27:21 ; 30:13 ; 32:29 ; 38:2-3 , 39:1 , 18 . 7 leader of exiles returning under Cyrus, according to Ezra 1:8 . 8 non-Israel chiefs in P: Gen 34:2 ; Num 25:18 ; Josh 13:21 . II. [ נָשִׂיא ] noun [masculine] rising mist, vapour (Arabic , ); — only plural נְשִׂאִים vapours , forming clouds, and portending rain, Jer 10:13 = 51:16 , Psa 135:7 , נְשִׂיאִים Prov 25:14 .","rootNote":"or נָשִׂא ; from 5375 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 2 10","keyReferences":["1Chr 2 10","1Chr 4 38","1Chr 5 6","1Chr 7 40","1Kgs 8 1","1Kgs 11 34","2Chr 1 2","2Chr 5 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":134,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 2 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְשִׂ֖יא","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 38","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":38,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְשִׂיאִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נָשִׂ֖יא","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 40","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נְּשִׂיאִ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 1","book":"